  "statuteText": "100-A:19-a Applicability. –\n\nThis subdivision applies to any member of the New Hampshire retirement system who has creditable service in both group I and group II, whether by reason of job re-classification, transfer from one job to another, or termination of employment in one job and re-employment in another. The provisions of this subdivision shall also apply as closely as they may reasonably be applied, as determined by the board of trustees, to persons who have creditable service in both the New Hampshire retirement system and a predecessor system."
